tmeld (0.5.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * bmeld: Meld served to a browser (also `tmeld --web`); now shipped in the
    package, depending on the system python3-aiohttp.
  * One shared command line for tmeld and bmeld (--web, --port, --bind).
  * TUI: Esc quits, per-pane overview maps, left-hand scrollbar, read-only
    /dev/null handling, tab-strip contrast fix, gutter icons drawn into the
    linkmap. Line numbers off by default.
  * maint/mkdeb.sh stamps builds so rebuilds upgrade in place.

 -- mitnits <alexa.mitnitski@gmail.com>  Wed, 09 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0300

tmeld (0.4.0) unstable; urgency=medium

  * First Debian packaging of tmeld.
  * Upstream 0.4.0: 2/3-way file merge, folder comparison, VC view,
    tabbed shell, Tier-2 pixel linkmap (sixel/kitty graphics).

